#==============================================================================================
#
#   grid_formatting_context_1 - Layout::GridFormattingContext: grid items, alignment keywords,
#                               grid tracks, construction and repeat() counts
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/GridFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1-269) and the inline members of
#       GridFormattingContext.h: a grid item's spans, positions, sizes and margins in either
#       dimension, the occupation grid's inline members, the context's inline members (the
#       grid container, gaps, flexible tracks, and the traversal of the tracks and gaps an item
#       spans as an iterator), the four to_alignment conversions, the GridTrack factories, the
#       constructor, the size of a definite track and the number of auto-fill / auto-fit
#       repetitions (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-2/#auto-repeat).
#
